<title>NETHERLANDS: Ogden to handle KLM cargo at Spanish airport.</title>
<headline>Ogden to handle KLM cargo at Spanish airport.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLM Royal Dutch Airlines has appointed Ogden Cargo, part of the Netherlands Ogden Aviation, as its cargo ground handler in both Madrid and Barcelona airports.</p>
<p>But Cargo Service Centre, a subsidiary of KLM, will be responsible for handling administration, a KLM Cargo spokesman said.</p>
<p>Cargo Service Centre has a base at Zaragoza airport in Spain.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
